        69.16120147705078,
        527.0,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "appreciate that monitoring of laboratory work and training is easier",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98819351196289,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.31520080566406,
        79.11609649658203,
        82.22920227050781
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        79.11609649658203,
        69.31520080566406,
        196.15350341796875,
        82.22920227050781
      ],
      "text": "Laboratory managers",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 10.98819351196289,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        84.66120147705078,
        525.5126953125,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "than with sputum microscopy, and that use of low complexity automated NAATs eases staff",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.979881286621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.9359130859375,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "retention because it increases staff satisfaction and is symbolic of progress within the TB world.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.84819793701172,
        183.19244384765625,
        128.7292022705078
      ],
      "text": "QES: low confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.65382385253906,
        305.39483642578125,
        155.5678253173828
      ],
      "text": "What would be the impact on health equity?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        166.5037841796875,
        527.206787109375,
        179.64878845214844
      ],
      "text": "The impact on health equity would be similar to that of moderate complexity automated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        182.0037841796875,
        301.3349609375,
        195.14878845214844
      ],
      "text": "NAATs: Chapter 2.1.2 of the current guidelines.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        206.1616973876953,
        336.63470458984375,
        219.07569885253906
      ],
      "text": "Is the intervention acceptable to key stakeholders?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        230.0115966796875,
        527.0791015625,
        243.15660095214844
      ],
      "text": "The acceptability to key stakeholders is similar to that of moderate complexity automated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        245.5115966796875,
        301.3349609375,
        258.6566162109375
      ],
      "text": "NAATs: Chapter 2.1.2 of the current guidelines.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.515625,
        526.96337890625,
        282.66064453125
      ],
      "text": "The identified challenges in implementing the use of low complexity automated NAATs and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        285.015625,
        526.9644775390625,
        298.16064453125
      ],
      "text": "accumulated delays at every step may compromise the added value and benefits identified",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.515625,
        526.904052734375,
        313.66064453125
      ],
      "text": "by the users (e.g. avoiding delays, keeping costs low, accurate results, information on drug",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        316.015625,
        526.9462890625,
        329.16064453125
      ],
      "text": "resistance and easing laboratory work), ultimately leading to use.  If these  QES: high confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984990119934082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.515625,
        526.9847412109375,
        344.66064453125
      ],
      "text": "values are not met, it can be assumed that users are less likely to find low complexity automated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.956914901733398,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        347.015625,
        162.60580444335938,
        360.16064453125
      ],
      "text": "NAATs acceptable.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.1734924316406,
        290.5672302246094,
        384.0874938964844
      ],
      "text": "Is the intervention feasible to implement?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.02349853515625,
        78.81909942626953,
        408.16851806640625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        395.02349853515625,
        526.9653930664062,
        408.16851806640625
      ],
      "text": "Low complexity automated NAATs may decrease the workload in the laboratory in terms",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        410.52349853515625,
        524.3519897460938,
        423.66851806640625
      ],
      "text": "of freeing up time for laboratory staff. However, based on experience with Xpert MTB/",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        426.02349853515625,
        527.0072631835938,
        439.16851806640625
      ],
      "text": "RIF (Ultra), the introduction of a new class of technologies may increase the workload of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        441.52349853515625,
        526.96435546875,
        454.66851806640625
      ],
      "text": "laboratory staff if added onto existing work without adjusting staffing arrangements or if",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        457.02349853515625,
        389.3158874511719,
        470.16851806640625
      ],
      "text": "the new technology does not replace existing diagnostic tests.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        472.71051025390625,
        212.83746337890625,
        485.59149169921875
      ],
      "text": "QES: moderate confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.02349853515625,
        78.81909942626953,
        501.16851806640625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        488.02349853515625,
        526.9202270507812,
        501.16851806640625
      ],
      "text": "Low complexity automated NAATs require less user training than other DST methods (e.g.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        503.52349853515625,
        526.965576171875,
        516.6685180664062
      ],
      "text": "LPA and culture), making these tests more feasible to implement than methods with more",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        519.0234985351562,
        395.7847595214844,
        532.1685180664062
      ],
      "text": "user steps and those that require significant additional training.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        534.7105102539062,
        158.97039794921875,
        547.5914916992188
      ],
      "text": "Interview study",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        550.0234985351562,
        527.1161499023438,
        563.1685180664062
      ],
      "text": "Implementation of new diagnostics must be accompanied by training for clinicians, to help",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998600006103516,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        565.5234985351562,
        526.9862060546875,
        578.6685180664062
      ],
      "text": "them interpret results from new molecular tests and understand how this relates to the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        581.0234375,
        527.0193481445312,
        594.16845703125
      ],
      "text": "treatment of a patient. In the past, with the introduction of Xpert MTB/RIF (Ultra), this has",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        596.5234375,
        291.9247741699219,
        609.66845703125
      ],
      "text": "been a challenge and has led to underuse.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        612.21044921875,
        284.8655090332031,
        625.0914306640625
      ],
      "text": "QES: high confidence and interview study",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        627.5234375,
        524.4453735351562,
        640.66845703125
      ],
      "text": "Introduction of Xpert MTB/RIF (Ultra) has also led to overreliance on results of cartridge-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        643.0234375,
        317.96087646484375,
        656.16845703125
      ],
      "text": "based NAATs at the expense of clinical acumen.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03409576416016,
        658.71044921875,
        212.8321533203125,
        671.5914306640625
      ],
      "text": "QES: moderate confidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.0234375,
        78.81909942626953,
        687.16845703125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        674.0234375,
        526.9420776367188,
        687.16845703125
      ],
      "text": "Introduction of new diagnostics must also be accompanied by guidelines and algorithms",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        689.5234375,
        527.2393188476562,
        702.66845703125
      ],
      "text": "that support clinicians and laboratories in communicating with each other; for example,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        705.0234375,
        527.1476440429688,
        718.16845703125
      ],
      "text": "these resources allow clinicians and laboratories to discuss discordant results, and interpret",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998449325561523,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        720.5234375,
        527.0072021484375,
        733.66845703125
      ],
      "text": "laboratory results in the context of drug availability, patient history and patient progress on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.991646766662598,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        736.0234375,
        201.63829040527344,
        749.16845703125
      ],
      "text": "a current drug regimen.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03409576416016,
        751.71044921875,
        134.5670928955078,
        764.5914306640625
      ],
      "text": "Interviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "80 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
